# Large binaries / firmware are not committed here — see README "Firmware images".
*.bin
*.zip
*.img
*.itb
*.dtb

# Per-device identity / secrets must NEVER be committed to this public repo.
photos/
*spi-stock-*.bin
*sheets_token*.json
*-token.json

# Python / OS cruft and scratch.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
tmp/

# Exception (must come last to override the broader excludes above): the
# dev-unit gale's stock SPI backup is committed as a recovery reference.
# Its VPD (serial / mlb_serial / MAC / region) is for this single dev unit
# only; other pucks' stock dumps are still considered private.
!gale-spi-stock-2026-05-28.bin

# Exception: this dev unit's EC (STM32F072CB) firmware dumps, read read-only
# over the EC debug console ('md'). Unlike the SPI image these carry NO
# per-device identity (the EC code is the same factory image on every gale
# unit; the option bytes are config only), so they are safe to publish here.
!gale-ec-gale_v1.1.5337-0115719-2026-06-04.bin
!gale-ec-systemmem-bootloader-2026-06-04.bin
!gale-ec-optionbytes-2026-06-04.bin

# Exception: the Renode equivalence harness vendors the option bytes (a copy of
# the dump above, sha256 cdb247d4…) so the harness is self-contained.
!gale-ec/renode/data/gale-optionbytes.bin
